  "releaseNotes": "4.0.0: Hubitat-only rewrite. Removed SmartThings code. Device network ids now use the AlarmDecoder MAC address; existing devices are renamed in place the first time you open the app or press Done (rules and dashboards keep working). The app now follows the AlarmDecoder to a new IP address automatically, relink no longer duplicates devices, and Rebuild only creates missing devices. Added SecurityKeypad, networkStatus and faultedZones to the network appliance. After upgrading, open the AlarmDecoder service app and press Done.",
